BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:AI Series: AI-Powered Content Strategy
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260513T050000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260513T063000
UID:4aa27e1821bc3954c96fa8ac51d3f001@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Creating consistent\, high-quality content doesn't have to be 
 overwhelming- it just needs the right system. Led by Tom Collopy of Automa
 ted Consulting Group\, this session focuses on how to actually put AI to w
 ork in your content strategy- not just experiment with tools. Drawing from
  real-world experience deploying AI ino business workflows\, Tom will walk
  through practical ways to plan\, create\, and scale content using AI whil
 e keeping your voice clear\, authentic\, and on-brand. Participants will l
 earn how to streamline content creation across formats while improving SEO
 \, reducing time spent on repetitive tasks\, and building a sustainable co
 ntent engine.
LOCATION:Wake Forest\, NC
URL:https://chambermaster.wakeforestchamber.org/events/details/ai-series-a
 i-powered-content-strategy
X-SOURCE:Wake Forest Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:AI Series: Data Driven Decision Making with AI
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260616T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260616T103000
UID:136b974102897556a88dc63d7938078c@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Good decisions start with clear\, usable data. This session fo
 cuses on how AI can help businesses collect\, analyze\, and visualize info
 rmation to support smarter\, faster decision-making. Participants will exp
 lore practical ways to turn raw data into meaningful insights using dashbo
 ards\, visualizations\, and basic forecasting tools. The emphasis is on un
 derstanding trends\, identifying opportunitites\, and using predictive ins
 ights to guide planning and strategy- without needing a data science backg
 round. You'll learn how to: Collect and organize business data for analysi
 s Visualize key metrics and performance trends Use AI-supported forecastin
 g to inform decisions
LOCATION:Wake Forest\, NC
URL:https://chambermaster.wakeforestchamber.org/events/details/ai-series-d
 ata-driven-decision-making-with-ai
X-SOURCE:Wake Forest Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:AI Series: AI in E-Commerce & Customer Retention
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260714T050000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260714T063000
UID:747f32db03e97f475dee4d3921acd0e3@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:In today's competitive online marketplace\, retaining customer
 s is just as important as acquiring them. This session explores how AI can
  help e-commerce businesses better understand customer behavior and create
  more personalized\, timely engagement. Participamts will learn how AI-dri
 ven tools can support product recommendations\, predict customer churn\, a
 nd segment audiences for targeted communication. The focus is on practical
  applications that strengthen relationships and drive repeat business.
LOCATION:Wake Forest\, NC
URL:https://chambermaster.wakeforestchamber.org/events/details/ai-series-a
 i-in-e-commerce-customer-retention
X-SOURCE:Wake Forest Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
