 d to attend our Elected Officials Reception\, hosted by WakeMed North Hosp
 ital. Meet and mingle with other Chamber members and your local elected of
 ficials while enjoying refreshments and food provided by Falls Cafe\, Wake
 Med North Hospital's onsite restaurant. WakeMed North Hospital is located 
 at the corner of Falls of Neuse Road and Durant Road. Coming from Wake For
 est-Falls of Neuse Road: After crossing Capital Blvd.\, follow Falls of Ne
 use Road approximately 5 miles. After the Ravens Ridge Road intersection\,
  take the second WakeMed entrance on your left (NOT the emergency entrance
 )\, just before you reach the traffic light at Durant Road. You may park i
 n the surface parking lot directly on the left as you enter the campus. Co
 ming From Wake Forest- Capital Blvd: At the intersection of Capital Blvd. 
 and Durant Road (Dunkin Donuts on the corner) make a right at the traffic 
 light onto Durant Road. Follow Durant Road for approxim
LOCATION:Wake Forest\, NC
URL:https://chambermaster.wakeforestchamber.org/events/details/elected-off
 icials-reception-wakemed
