 we host Business After Hours at the Wake Forest FUNGO ballpark. (Flaherty 
 Park Field 2) This isn't your typical networking event. Enjoy a relaxed\, 
 outdoor setting with great energy\, local business leaders\, and a firstha
 nd look at one of Wake Forest's favorite summer traditions. Bring plenty o
 f business cards\, dress for the weather\, and come ready to connect. We a
 re excited to Roll FUNGO with you!
