SUMMARY:Ribbon Cutting: Cross Fox Farms Wake County
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260515T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260515T100000
UID:a51d1f0a1b31be8cd8eb1131017b6ed7@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Join Us for Our Ribbon Cutting Celebration May 15 at 12:00 PM 
 We have been keeping something special under wraps and the time has come t
 o open the gates. Celebrate with us at Cross Fox Farms Wake County as we o
 fficially unveil our new wedding and event space. In partnership with the 
 Wake Forest Chamber\, this milestone marks the beginning of an exciting ne
 w chapter for our venue and community. Be among the first to step inside\,
  explore the property\, and experience the vision brought to life. Enjoy a
  festive afternoon with guided tours\, light bites\, drinks\, and music in
  a beautiful countryside setting. We look forward to welcoming you to Cros
 s Fox Farms in Wake County.
LOCATION:Wake Forest\, NC
URL:https://chambermaster.wakeforestchamber.org/events/details/ribbon-cutt
 ing-cross-fox-farms-wake-county
X-SOURCE:Wake Forest Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
